{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And I will feed those who oppress you.</b> From the root of לא תונו איש את עמיתו (Leviticus 25:17). Others said: your scribes, like על ידי מונה (Jeremiah 33:13), for Israel is likened to a flock." "<b>Their blood.</b> From their blood. It is a figure of speech."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:58:48.705755201Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}